flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0607182Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0617893Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0618540Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0619065Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0619312Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0619639Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0620834Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0621152Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0621377Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0621809Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0622162Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0622803Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0623523Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0624059Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0624455Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0624647Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0624892Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0625170Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0625447Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0626057Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0626261Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0626398Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0626620Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0626912Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0627412Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0631450Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0631668Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0631934Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0632281Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0632987Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0633764Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0634434Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0634907Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0635398Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0636261Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0636891Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0649358Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0650166Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0662602Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0663269Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0663696Z 
