flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0687111Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0698271Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T21:28:18.0699094Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
